# Never ship bytecode or test caches into the image. The compiled stub
# migrations that lived in alembic/versions/__pycache__ with no .py source
# (70a7f8910db4, a66d9ae43682) got here this way — see
# docs/SERVER-INFRASTRUCTURE.md, "Recovering a database stamped at a deleted
# revision".
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
.env
*.db
